      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hilton_Head_Island%2C_South_Carolina",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "During the Civil War, Confederate troops stationed a fort on the island, and its guns protected the 2‑mile‑wide entrance to Port Royal Sound.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
