      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The historic Harbour Town Lighthouse, perched on a bluff overlooking the sea, has become the island’s most recognizable landmark.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
